# Journal reviewer checklist (CPS paper)

Use with **`cps-journal-reviewer`** only. Reviewer **never edits** files.

## Primary sources

| Source | Path |
|--------|------|
| Manuscript | `new/src/paper/overleaf_upload/main.tex` |
| Twin | `new/src/paper/main.ltx` (parity check) |
| Professor PDF notes | `pdf4_comments.md` |
| Done / pending fixes | `pdf4_changes_summary.md`, `corrections_requested.md` |
| Numbers | `tables/macros_cps.tex`, `tables/macros_ablation.tex`, `tables/macros_perchunk.tex` |

## Review axes (every full audit)

1. **Claims vs evidence** — RQ1–RQ6, macros, overclaim (co-design headline, zero-stall, best ABR).
2. **Statistics** — paired design, Wilcoxon, TOST at ε, raw vs corrected p-values, n=204 vs 12 titles clustering.
3. **Clarity** — pairing, Fig↔Table bridge, telegraphic §5, undefined terms (SI/TI, LOS, rung, conformal).
4. **Notation & percentages** — signed Δ (−4.5%) vs prose ("reduced" + negative = double negative); abstract readability.
5. **Structure** — professor MOVE items (→§2, →§5, →conclusion, after references); orphan blocks.
6. **Related work** — gaps vs Conformal-ABR, SafeSABR, Kairos; positioning table completeness.
7. **Tense** — author work past; method description present.
8. **Formatting** — `\figref`/`\tabref`, `vs.\`, bitrate/rebuffering not `X%/Y%`.
9. **Limitations honesty** — synthetic 5G, exchangeability, broadband 0.890, single-seed co-design.
10. **Reproducibility** — macro sync, figure/table captions match data.

## Professor PDF themes (verify open/closed)

- Pairing unexplained (p.17) — fixed?
- Fig 3 vs Table 5 link (p.17) — fixed?
- Negative slash `X%/Y%` (p.18) — fixed?
- Telegraphic eval prose (p.22) — open?
- Section moves / deletions (p.9,14,15,16,28,29) — open?
- Missing citations (p.17) — open?
- Mark-only `???` — needs PDF map

## Severity labels

| Label | Meaning |
|-------|---------|
| **FATAL** | Wrong number, false claim, broken logic |
| **MAJOR** | Reviewer would reject or demand revision |
| **MINOR** | Clarity, style, polish |
| **NIT** | Typography only |

## Reviewer output contract

Persian report; per finding: **ID**, **severity**, **section/line**, **issue**, **suggested fix**, **evidence path**. No file edits.
